      <p>
        <strong>2009-2016 (Drone Era)</strong>: Military spending averaged $600-650 billion. Deaths from American military action: approximately 25,000-50,000 direct, many more enabled (drones, Libya, Syria). My taxpayer contribution: approximately $45,000-55,000.
